261	// pool's or a crew's, is refused; so is a person already
262	// in the pool, or a share not more than 0.00 and at most 100.00 with up to two decimals. A member may be another pool
263	// (chosen as pool:<name>): of at most one pool, never containing itself through any chain, in a chain at most three
264	// deep. A pool that is a member of another has no pot of its own: its pot is its cut in the pool above; the sheet's
265	// pot is the pot of each pool that is a member of none.
266	@Component({
